            {
                "entry_id": "1d585b31-2af4-3bdd-ad22-e3ced45a4952",
                "word": "guéguerre",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "bd67cb79-26e1-44f3-adcc-5d9df18d7230",
                        "entry_id": "1d585b31-2af4-3bdd-ad22-e3ced45a4952",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "guéguerres"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "67badb38-a0f3-3bce-a18d-ea7c8cc233c5",
                        "entry_id": "1d585b31-2af4-3bdd-ad22-e3ced45a4952",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Petit conflit, débat sans importance, démêlé mineur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "familiar",
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0341fa84-33de-49b8-a056-53f970b17f51",
                                "sense_id": "67badb38-a0f3-3bce-a18d-ea7c8cc233c5",
                                "text": "Au premier regard, tu as l’impression que c’est une petite guéguerre, pour élire celui qui aura la plus belle voiture."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f98d2002-059e-44c2-b084-0bee07449d97",
                                "sense_id": "67badb38-a0f3-3bce-a18d-ea7c8cc233c5",
                                "text": "La guéguerre ne s'arrêtera pas, même après l'adoption de la loi Travail, car dans le viseur des frondeurs, il y a la présidentielle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdca34cc-d36b-40e3-b2d9-3aecb4d29951",
                                "sense_id": "67badb38-a0f3-3bce-a18d-ea7c8cc233c5",
                                "text": "Et, heureusement pour la galerie, [est présente] la prise de guéguerre Virginie Calmels, que l’auréole de juppéiste avait fini par classer parmi les modérés…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bce9cef6-6832-4d7e-99fd-5195c263893a",
                                "sense_id": "67badb38-a0f3-3bce-a18d-ea7c8cc233c5",
                                "text": "L’opinion publique lui est favorable, mais les guéguerres avec Ottawa ne ramèneront pas les 10 000 morts à la vie."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4ccc7505-55f5-4892-a193-7085c4f4414a",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d585b31-2af4-3bdd-ad22-e3ced45a4952",
                        "source_sense_id": "67badb38-a0f3-3bce-a18d-ea7c8cc233c5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kleinkrieg",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Kleinkrieg",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b735b41-63d2-3677-ae3d-56b713af8788",
                                        "entry_id": "ebbb834e-5357-36b4-b92e-d317b88a95ad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Konflikt zwischen zwei oder mehr Parteien um eher Unbedeutendes"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fae43529-dd4c-4601-9033-085e63e5bdfb",
                                                "sense_id": "5b735b41-63d2-3677-ae3d-56b713af8788",
                                                "text": "Müller und Schulze liefern sich seit Jahren einen erbitterten Kleinkrieg."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28afc639-8e97-41e6-9b7f-cb75ae1df495",
                                                "sense_id": "5b735b41-63d2-3677-ae3d-56b713af8788",
                                                "text": "Der Kleinkrieg zwischen den verschiedenen Lagern in der Partei will kein Ende nehmen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2373b549-72ec-4067-a543-9ae82d901617",
                                                "sense_id": "5b735b41-63d2-3677-ae3d-56b713af8788",
                                                "text": "Gegen die regulären Truppen konnten sie mangels ausreichender Bewaffnung nur einen Kleinkrieg führen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5258113-449b-44c8-abab-c8393a938bfb",
                                                "sense_id": "5b735b41-63d2-3677-ae3d-56b713af8788",
                                                "text": "„Der Kleinkrieg mit den Arabern hatte längst begonnen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "62be9f1f-d1ff-4109-b101-c5df55f0facd",
                        "source_entry_id": "1d585b31-2af4-3bdd-ad22-e3ced45a4952",
                        "source_sense_id": "67badb38-a0f3-3bce-a18d-ea7c8cc233c5",
                        "target_lang_word": "squabble",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "squabble",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51c8e3ef-c707-3b31-91ec-df98369c17e6",
                                        "entry_id": "29595f59-aa5f-3f4c-b487-42a4a1b6da30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A minor fight or argument."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c559046-2967-4b23-a279-328177d489cf",
                                                "sense_id": "51c8e3ef-c707-3b31-91ec-df98369c17e6",
                                                "text": "The children got into a squabble about who should ride in the front of the car."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4bcb1517-1ac0-46e9-9a5f-9b79fe177f63",
                                                "sense_id": "51c8e3ef-c707-3b31-91ec-df98369c17e6",
                                                "text": "It was obvious to the inhabitants of the small coastal town of Bridport that in the midst of these squabbles their need for a railway was going to be overlooked, and they decided to take the matter into their own hands."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d574b837-4043-4840-b9bf-8deab1e587ed",
                                                "sense_id": "51c8e3ef-c707-3b31-91ec-df98369c17e6",
                                                "text": "\"p your mess.\nAlso, as apologetic as you were for occupying my time, which I had hoped to spend with my daughter, you used about twice as many words as you needed to, and wasted an entire paragraph complaining about your colleagues. I went back to the SCP-079 file — Supervisor Valis would have had the thing decommissioned years ago if it weren't for your blatant technofetishism. Yet, you have the gall to characterize the Foundation's ongoing political interventions and military operations as squabbles.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "squabble",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63eaec59-577a-3940-b3f6-aaa362cce4b5",
                                        "entry_id": "f2bf65eb-7d2b-33b9-983c-e65c7a92f709",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To participate in a minor fight or argument; to quarrel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0fb8b4d-f007-496e-8914-ab57a8cf7a75",
                                                "sense_id": "63eaec59-577a-3940-b3f6-aaa362cce4b5",
                                                "text": "The brothers were always squabbling with each other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b605129-04c1-428f-892c-d464061fcabe",
                                                "sense_id": "63eaec59-577a-3940-b3f6-aaa362cce4b5",
                                                "text": "The sense of these propositions is very plain and easy, though logicians might perhaps squabble a whole day whether they should rank them under negative or affirmative."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b815eb7-42e0-3a30-911e-f7fafa876298",
                                        "entry_id": "f2bf65eb-7d2b-33b9-983c-e65c7a92f709",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To disarrange, so that the letters or lines stand awry and require readjustment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ad81973-745a-4a6f-81c5-9708c3d9eb59",
                                                "sense_id": "6b815eb7-42e0-3a30-911e-f7fafa876298",
                                                "text": "to squabble type"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
